## Approved exact-set add implementation and real UI success — 2026-10-19

The user explicitly approved the exact boundary recorded in `set-add-proposal.md`. Saved six source/document originals and their hashes in `pre-approved-set-add.tar.gz` before editing; checkpoint d2beeba and all earlier failures remain recoverable.

